 more per byte, algorithms, prefetch, local memory, texture compression, frame buffer compression, memory scheduling. Finish.\n\nNeed about 400 words. Let's count. Draft:\n\n\"Imagine a GPU is a huge kitchen with 10,000 chefs. The chefs can chop, mix, and plate incredibly fast, but every dish needs ingredients from the pantry. If the pantry has only one narrow aisle, the chefs can stand around waiting for carrots, flour, and sauce. The cooking speed is not", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0007118731737136841], [760, -7.962051868438721]], [[1144, -3.027961793122813e-05], [1902, -11.059061050415039]], [[4087, -0.6575524210929871], [310, -0.7999283075332642]], [[1156, -0.035467490553855896], [303, -3.4800302982330322]], [[579, -0.1714310348033905], [25, -1.9776616096496582]], [[1622, -0.0013196230866014957], [3296, -6.822238445281982]], [[25, -0.4312666058540344], [13, -1.2693899869918823]], [[10033, -0.3394852578639984], [79091, -1.7593269348144531]], [[310, -0.006332317367196083], [303, -5.087900161743164]], [[21520, -0.09100857377052307], [1496, -2.450566530227661]], [[1496, -0.004672938026487827], [32308, -5.37287712097168]], [[33541, -0.013111339882016182], [2812, -4.3414764404296875]], [[5286, -0.00011373213055776432], [261, -9.254836082458496]], [[11, -0.26109862327575684], [303, -1.880187749862671]], [[883, -0.0491018183529377], [303, -3.6321840286254883]], [[220, -4.768382950715022e-06], [19, -12.868775367736816]], [[19, -3.027961793122813e-05], [20, -11.072845458984375]], [[15, -2.0265784769435413e-05], [18, -11.284584999084473]], [[15, -1.0728841743912199e-06], [16, -14.724833488464355]], [[4105, -2.7418175250204513e-06], [3069, -13.153964042663574]], [[11, -0.0015151648549363017], [13, -6.549874305725098]], [[3069, -5.722062269342132e-06], [33488, -13.375249862670898]], [[21966, -0.4646044075489044], [13775, -1.0526458024978638]], [[628, -0.6950734257698059], [6973, -0.7095025181770325]], [[381, -9.417578439752106e-06], [6973, -11.748517990112305]], [[6973, -0.0031763